BEGIN_DESC
TANTRA BETA 1 - Mars, Valles Marineris: astronaut with the jet pack next to Tantra.
Coprates Chasma floor, 4.3 km below datum; canyon walls 5-8 km high. Niza Krit in the suit with the jet pack on (12 kg metallic hydrogen, 2 x 500 N, ~950 m/s). Tantra lies 60 m away, main airlock lift down.

ON FOOT: W/S walk (S brakes), A/D turn, Q/E side step, Shift run. F1 eyes / outside view. Right mouse held (eyes view): look around. H suit computer, L lamps, Shift+V sun shade. F = action (shown on screen).
JET PACK: starts in MANUAL (no compensation). Space thrust up, left Ctrl down; Shift+Space full thrust, Shift+Ctrl thrust off (while held). Numpad 0 / . throttle. In the air: W/S pod vector (forward / brake), A/D turn, Q/E strafe, Shift full vector. J height hold, C landing autopilot, G booms, Caps Lock steering limiter.
SUIT COMPUTER (eyes view, mouse): toggle ASSIST (top right) for safe thrust, upright hold and ground braking; buttons at the bottom of the right page: height hold, TRANSFER (pick a target on TARGETS), LANDING, STOP (kill all speeds, hold height). FLIGHT page: cruise height and speed. Screens are in Russian in this beta.
TEST - SUPPORTS: walk into Tantra's cup feet (discs R 6-12 m): she must stop at the rim. Only the feet are solid in this beta (on foot, ship on the ground); hull, upper legs and anything in flight are not.
BOARDING: walk to the lift foot under the main airlock, F - board the lift, click UP inside the cabin.
Known: footsteps are heard in vacuum.
END_DESC

